Answer
As per Article 12B of UN Model Convention, “Automated digital services” means any service
provided on the Internet or another electronic network, in either case requiring minimal human
involvement from the service provider.
The term “Automated digital services” includes specially:
(a)
online advertising services;
(b)
online supply of user data;
{c)
online search engines;
(d)
online intermediation platform services;
(e)
social media platforms;
(f)
digital content services;
(g)
online gaming;
(h)
cloud computing services; and
(i) | standardized online teaching services.
